# Fog: "Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn." Deathtouch destroys only a creature that has been dealt
# damage by it (CR 702.2b), and lifelink gains only the damage dealt (CR 702.15b): damage that is prevented is never dealt
# (CR 615.1). Bot1's Bofur, Reliable Guardian (1/1 lifelink) attacks and Bot2's Dragon Sniper (1/1 deathtouch) blocks it;
